            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Agnieszka"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Whole Foods and most other stores stopped selling Mahi Mahi due to code Red overfishing; they suggested Tuna instead, due to its similar texture.\n\nFrom reading the previous reviews, I doubled the ginger amount. It was awesome! My friends said that it was one of the best dishes I made in a long time. Nice! :)",
